1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,760
Integration – seasons around the world A.

2
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:12,380
Simon is reading an article about the twenty-four solar terms.

3
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:17,140
Read with him and answer the questions below.

4
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:24,200
In ancient times, Chinese people noticed the changes in seasons and weather.

5
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,590
They divided the year into twenty-four parts.

6
00:00:27,590 --> 00:00:31,320
These are the twenty-four solar terms.

7
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:37,370
The terms start with the beginning of spring and end with the major cold.

8
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:43,490
They show changes in crop growth, temperature and other weather conditions.

9
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:52,160
Today, many farmers still use the twenty-four solar terms to help decide what to do in their fields.

10
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:57,560
The terms also have important cultural meanings beyond farming.

11
00:00:57,560 --> 00:01:01,340
Some of them are connected with traditional festivals.

12
00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:06,580
They have had a positive effect on Chinese culture for thousands of years.
